OL,3,AFort Hood shooter to be executed by
OL,4,Afiring squad - a first for US military
OL,5,Asince World War Two
OL,6,
OL,7,FThe Pentagon has announced it will
OL,8,Fexecute a former US Army major by
OL,9,Ffiring squad, the first such military
OL,10,Fexecution in more than 60 years.
OL,12,FNidal Malik Hasan, a US Army major and
OL,13,Fphysician, fatally shot 13 unarmed US
OL,14,Fsoldiers at Fort Hood in 2009, injuring
OL,15,Fanother 32.
OL,17,FPentagon spokesperson Sean Parnell
OL,18,Fannounced on social media on Monday
OL,19,Fthat Secretary of War Pete Hegseth had
OL,20,Fmade the recommendation and President
OL,21,FDonald Trump approved it.
OL,23,APub: 06-OctQppppppppppppppppppppppG1/2
OL,24,ANext PageB Nat NewsC Nat TVF Clean Feed
